{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2023-01-31 10:05:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY DONATES $1.3 MILLION TO ENVIRONMENTAL NON-PROFITS', 'text': 'ENVIRONMENTAL GRANTS AWARDED TO 97 ORGANIZATIONS ACROSS 8 STATES MORE THAN $400,000 DONATED TO 35 ORGANIZATIONS IN VIRGINIA GRANTS FOCUS ON ENVIRONMENTAL EDUCATION AND STEWARDSHIP INITIATIVES RICHMOND, VA. , JAN. 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE DOMINION ENERGY CHARITABLE FOUNDATION HAS AWARDED $1.3 MILLION IN GRANT FUNDING TO 97 ENVIRONMENTAL ORGANIZATIONS ACROSS EIGHT STATES, INCLUDING MORE THAN $400,000 TO 35 ORGANIZATIONS IN VIRGINIA.'}